        "filing_date": "2026-04-29",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We are managed by Stealth Maritime, a privately owned company controlled by the Vafias Group, which has been active in shipping for over 50 years and is controlled by the Vafias family, of which Harry Vafias, our Chief Executive Officer, is a member.",
