        "filing_date": "2026-04-29",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.86,
        "statement": "Vessels operating in the spot market generate revenues that are less predictable but may enable us to capture increased profit margins during periods of improvements in tanker charter rates, although we are then exposed to the risk of declining tanker charter rates.",
